  "title": "Add an Auto Battle Command [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "自動戦闘コマンドを追加【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "e0fea11c54a41c17a6da67447e35f5a901cf0657768c2ffb09cb6b23b5df7e78",
      "translation": "Add an Auto Battle Command [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "e0fea11c54a41c17a6da67447e35f5a901cf0657768c2ffb09cb6b23b5df7e78"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "自動戦闘コマンドを追加します。",
      "sourceHash": "989e11e2aa1aa95680393015de9c6604fc872b27f8f08ea499ddb846623e69b3",
      "translation": "Adds an Auto Battle command.",
      "contextHash": "989e11e2aa1aa95680393015de9c6604fc872b27f8f08ea499ddb846623e69b3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "キャンセルキーを押すまで自動で戦闘を実行するようになります。",
      "sourceHash": "1e047959ef5823695d1c7e2c5f60ab418f4157dc4ed27b3c9d29a0c868dcf34a",
      "translation": "Battle will proceed automatically until the cancel key is pressed.",
      "contextHash": "1e047959ef5823695d1c7e2c5f60ab418f4157dc4ed27b3c9d29a0c868dcf34a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※タッチ操作でも右クリックで解除、または左クリック長押しで解除します。",
      "sourceHash": "7a02d8c11db5eb30b90927dbec733bab655a6ff5e1c53fcad54c31f935dfbbf4",
      "translation": "※With touch controls, right-click to cancel, or press and hold the left mouse button to cancel.",
      "contextHash": "7a02d8c11db5eb30b90927dbec733bab655a6ff5e1c53fcad54c31f935dfbbf4"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "初期状態では特徴の『特殊フラグ』の自動戦闘と同様の挙動を取りますが、通常攻撃だけをさせることも可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "d98459db38113dacac527e08580ec15da43193e55933f300cfebc1f15fbce4d1",
      "translation": "By default, it behaves like the Auto Battle feature under the Special Flags trait, but it can also be configured to use normal attacks only.",
      "contextHash": "d98459db38113dacac527e08580ec15da43193e55933f300cfebc1f15fbce4d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のファイルを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "7f5880d732c954e0e725bc277f22b64c316416f8cec8a7b7a0622deed1c8217a",
      "translation": "Right-click and save the following file, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the feature ON from the plugin manager in RPG Maker.",
      "contextHash": "7f5880d732c954e0e725bc277f22b64c316416f8cec8a7b7a0622deed1c8217a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NRP_AutoBattle.js",
      "sourceHash": "55e53b5ccb5baf8fa226a31036193b6b043040c1ce95cc56be5b23b8f548ddc6",
      "translation": "NRP_AutoBattle.js ",
      "contextHash": "6f07af6ae70d47767aae3c3cf26a506b9a46b763917ccb0a41a4eae5b513a623"
    },
    {
