      "contextHash": "5242a94ebbdcaead35c4f6671d353b54eca68e92f27a468063199f3daed773fc"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "ショートカットキーを設定可能にした。",
      "sourceHash": "1a090962d5bc17c49c246a9377d94638fd10dd46745c0d20c3ebb026b085cae9",
      "translation": "Shortcut keys can now be configured.",
      "contextHash": "1a090962d5bc17c49c246a9377d94638fd10dd46745c0d20c3ebb026b085cae9"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-002",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "※ＭＶでは正常に動作しない模様です。（2024/12/20 ver1.031で明記）",
      "sourceHash": "5cebb351c403e29a3f40162e3342d1345bfb0640af78ed57c67d2d27c775c88d",
      "translation": "※It apparently does not work correctly in MV. (Noted in ver1.031 on 2024/12/20)",
      "contextHash": "5cebb351c403e29a3f40162e3342d1345bfb0640af78ed57c67d2d27c775c88d"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-003",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "自動戦闘開始時、およびキャンセル時の効果音を追加した。",
      "sourceHash": "85373ee8f7d0d4065f1300eacfc5e52b3721ca2362d7397293aff7ed0b863ab5",
      "translation": "Added sound effects for starting and canceling Auto Battle.",
      "contextHash": "85373ee8f7d0d4065f1300eacfc5e52b3721ca2362d7397293aff7ed0b863ab5"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-004",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "自動戦闘時のみオンになるスイッチを追加した。",
      "sourceHash": "d752aaae07f3eed6e8acaebc6b96a71214bb4587e9698054e235688ff8d3fbc7",
      "translation": "Added a switch that turns on only during Auto Battle.",
      "contextHash": "d752aaae07f3eed6e8acaebc6b96a71214bb4587e9698054e235688ff8d3fbc7"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2024/01/04 -> 2024/03/28（ver1.02 -> 1.021）",
      "sourceHash": "c0744d2c4077ad170ffa283519ee5aa2dc945d85e0a60e6b4dcc0db7b884f028",
      "translation": "2024/01/04 -> 2024/03/28 (ver1.02 -> 1.021) ",
      "contextHash": "c0744d2c4077ad170ffa283519ee5aa2dc945d85e0a60e6b4dcc0db7b884f028"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-005",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "タッチ操作でも右クリックで解除、または左クリック長押しで自動戦闘を解除するようにした。",
      "sourceHash": "33c9c3c1e3c5611d99a30516971dc829478d03531029c52cc605156d7f9908e5",
      "translation": "With touch controls, Auto Battle can now be canceled by right-clicking or by pressing and holding the left mouse button.",
      "contextHash": "33c9c3c1e3c5611d99a30516971dc829478d03531029c52cc605156d7f9908e5"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-006",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "ＣＴＢにて、戦闘開始時かつ敵のターン時に自動戦闘を行うとエラーになる不具合修正。（2024/03/28 ver1.021）",
      "sourceHash": "fbddd3eb461ab0922b93d2c71aeb2e6770553db12017a752178175c1f8a1ed43",
      "translation": "Fixed an issue in CTB where an error occurred when Auto Battle was used at the start of battle during the enemy's turn. (2024/03/28 ver1.021)",
      "contextHash": "fbddd3eb461ab0922b93d2c71aeb2e6770553db12017a752178175c1f8a1ed43"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2023/07/11（ver1.01）",
      "sourceHash": "c66e60d80092a5e725d53ca99e69f41ccffe81a6637176ffea0269d6d6a46b7e",
      "translation": "2023/07/11 (ver1.01) ",
      "contextHash": "c66e60d80092a5e725d53ca99e69f41ccffe81a6637176ffea0269d6d6a46b7e"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-007",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "『１ターンのみ実行』がオフの場合、次の戦闘まで自動戦闘が継続されてしまう不具合修正。",
      "sourceHash": "781de65ce5b882d3b15682c0a52f550935dc070ed72e50b12808ac52be34d688",
      "translation": "Fixed an issue where Auto Battle continued until the next battle when \"Execute for only 1 turn\" was off.",
      "contextHash": "781de65ce5b882d3b15682c0a52f550935dc070ed72e50b12808ac52be34d688"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2023/04/09 -> 2023/04/10（ver1.00 -> 1.001）",
      "sourceHash": "830df76441b07172330b7553d35bae536fed3480e9186646c7e4c065b8357da5",
      "translation": "2023/04/09 -> 2023/04/10 (ver1.00 -> 1.001) ",
      "contextHash": "830df76441b07172330b7553d35bae536fed3480e9186646c7e4c065b8357da5"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-008",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "公開！",
      "sourceHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664",
      "translation": "Released!",
      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-009",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "ＴＰＢで詠唱開始時、詠唱ポーズを取らない不具合修正。",
      "sourceHash": "00715291d52c25aa5129e71c95e804a9b0d15999bcf353fae0a3a652565fe2ae",
      "translation": "Fixed an issue in TPB where the casting pose was not performed when casting began.",
      "contextHash": "00715291d52c25aa5129e71c95e804a9b0d15999bcf353fae0a3a652565fe2ae"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-010",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "（2023/04/10 ver1.001）",
      "sourceHash": "1c3ab91201d8adbbf82cdb131871b3ed3ca2b93ee5f8e4eafc069db5bfbf059a",
      "translation": " (2023/04/10 ver1.001) ",
      "contextHash": "1c3ab91201d8adbbf82cdb131871b3ed3ca2b93ee5f8e4eafc069db5bfbf059a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameter）",
      "sourceHash": "f4b540e9f0397a1265e0ce8b0574e8fade43b17d30f049312ef0f2eb5efd4805",
      "translation": "plugin parameter (Plugin Parameter) ",
      "contextHash": "f4b540e9f0397a1265e0ce8b0574e8fade43b17d30f049312ef0f2eb5efd4805"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "コマンド名（CommandName）",
      "sourceHash": "9559481480bde5b6427c31f3c6f22f37f26248b37ac3ee807944a4dea14e1b5b",
      "translation": "Command Name (CommandName)",
      "contextHash": "9559481480bde5b6427c31f3c6f22f37f26248b37ac3ee807944a4dea14e1b5b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "自動戦闘のコマンド名です。",
      "sourceHash": "84713b7fe8b4fb48779a11ac8fa4c6f7c652ce75fcfbcf1628805a030445499f",
      "translation": "The command name for Auto Battle.",
      "contextHash": "84713b7fe8b4fb48779a11ac8fa4c6f7c652ce75fcfbcf1628805a030445499f"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "パーティコマンド挿入位置（PartyCommandPosition）",
      "sourceHash": "e8d8e95bb6858ea54b4c8948cfd013cb4f0ebd6f5dde02aa9457f47f58f986c9",
      "translation": "Party Command Insertion Position (PartyCommandPosition)",
      "contextHash": "e8d8e95bb6858ea54b4c8948cfd013cb4f0ebd6f5dde02aa9457f47f58f986c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "パーティコマンドに挿入する際の位置です。",
      "sourceHash": "e928ab8cb074bbd90d1ab9dbe10e0fc525233a4ac2d3371293ffcce9b7884b1b",
      "translation": "The position at which to insert it into the party commands.",
      "contextHash": "e928ab8cb074bbd90d1ab9dbe10e0fc525233a4ac2d3371293ffcce9b7884b1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "0で先頭に挿入。",
      "sourceHash": "608811a57c40f4b679e7c7d912bde617a8fedd17266c1fcc825665b15e506742",
      "translation": "Enter 0 to insert it at the beginning.",
      "contextHash": "608811a57c40f4b679e7c7d912bde617a8fedd17266c1fcc825665b15e506742"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "不要な場合はDELキーで削除。",
      "sourceHash": "3e6e7eedab675a4289328c0d2ecb170708876b0cdeb7bed341126c75c7cde4c8",
      "translation": "Press the DEL key to remove it if unnecessary.",
      "contextHash": "3e6e7eedab675a4289328c0d2ecb170708876b0cdeb7bed341126c75c7cde4c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "アクターコマンド挿入位置（ActorCommandPosition）",
      "sourceHash": "f946810e518b121d30bb4f94b7963408e991b6a5e2e3f8e60a084bb8d6603aac",
      "translation": "Actor Command Insertion Position (ActorCommandPosition)",
      "contextHash": "f946810e518b121d30bb4f94b7963408e991b6a5e2e3f8e60a084bb8d6603aac"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "アクターコマンドに挿入する際の位置です。",
      "sourceHash": "4e1703feed2f9c89c51f7166a4e37234df435e7d380e88712b9e96feab168549",
      "translation": "The position at which to insert it into the actor commands.",
      "contextHash": "4e1703feed2f9c89c51f7166a4e37234df435e7d380e88712b9e96feab168549"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "0で先頭に挿入。",
      "sourceHash": "608811a57c40f4b679e7c7d912bde617a8fedd17266c1fcc825665b15e506742",
      "translation": "Enter 0 to insert it at the beginning.",
      "contextHash": "608811a57c40f4b679e7c7d912bde617a8fedd17266c1fcc825665b15e506742"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "不要な場合はDELキーで削除。",
      "sourceHash": "3e6e7eedab675a4289328c0d2ecb170708876b0cdeb7bed341126c75c7cde4c8",
      "translation": "Press the DEL key to remove it if unnecessary.",
      "contextHash": "3e6e7eedab675a4289328c0d2ecb170708876b0cdeb7bed341126c75c7cde4c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-012",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "通常攻撃のみ（NormalAttackOnly）",
      "sourceHash": "950591a4ced3b3ce9d8c9e1e7de3dfe046fbfaac86c75c44689b642aacb6a45e",
      "translation": "Normal Attacks Only (NormalAttackOnly)",
      "contextHash": "950591a4ced3b3ce9d8c9e1e7de3dfe046fbfaac86c75c44689b642aacb6a45e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "自動戦闘時に通常攻撃のみを行います。",
      "sourceHash": "6a728e850d4ea8d308dd74403591755731fc7657d8e6677f3432ea38d219040d",
      "translation": "Only normal attacks will be performed during Auto Battle.",
      "contextHash": "6a728e850d4ea8d308dd74403591755731fc7657d8e6677f3432ea38d219040d"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-013",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "先頭のみを狙う（TargetFrontOnly）",
      "sourceHash": "008faadf868af3ae80c0011b3f960e70e9b25466cf3707e60f13614024462d3f",
      "translation": "Target the Front Only (TargetFrontOnly)",
      "contextHash": "008faadf868af3ae80c0011b3f960e70e9b25466cf3707e60f13614024462d3f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "通常攻撃のみがオンの場合、先頭の敵のみを対象とします。",
      "sourceHash": "d6ce7b9e05768fff9deeff72b99d6e884800b7c00b553447a24796b14a02e95a",
      "translation": "When Normal Attacks Only is on, only the front enemy will be targeted.",
      "contextHash": "d6ce7b9e05768fff9deeff72b99d6e884800b7c00b553447a24796b14a02e95a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-014",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ショートカットキー（ShortcutKey）",
      "sourceHash": "99acc25e68af8fe96a07f8ea5e74e101f5bfd2875c592d2145117cfb4c794818",
      "translation": "Shortcut Key (ShortcutKey)",
      "contextHash": "99acc25e68af8fe96a07f8ea5e74e101f5bfd2875c592d2145117cfb4c794818"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "自動戦闘を実行するショートカットキーです。",
      "sourceHash": "57548d3f7a0f47df8fe933f711556943d06d159b13e030c2944983feed5c491b",
      "translation": "The shortcut key used to execute Auto Battle.",
      "contextHash": "57548d3f7a0f47df8fe933f711556943d06d159b13e030c2944983feed5c491b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※ＭＶでは正常に動きません。",
      "sourceHash": "cae6e454b8a00ddc213002b873f3ce0c3a6efb2b41e5a46ec6179dad99f7d27d",
      "translation": "※It does not work correctly in MV.",
      "contextHash": "cae6e454b8a00ddc213002b873f3ce0c3a6efb2b41e5a46ec6179dad99f7d27d"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-015",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "同じキーで解除（ReleaseSameKey）",
      "sourceHash": "ea6e1941bd09a70e610e7d0d00d42f4bf796d2a545ea6dd090290c08b8a80b07",
      "translation": "Release with the Same Key (ReleaseSameKey)",
      "contextHash": "ea6e1941bd09a70e610e7d0d00d42f4bf796d2a545ea6dd090290c08b8a80b07"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ショートカットキーと同じキーで自動戦闘を解除できるようにします。",
      "sourceHash": "aee113a19e701c6fe31f5e2ce620828eb80dd0f577186f9e0b704d3c7821ae4c",
      "translation": "Allows Auto Battle to be canceled using the same key as the shortcut key.",
      "contextHash": "aee113a19e701c6fe31f5e2ce620828eb80dd0f577186f9e0b704d3c7821ae4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-016",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "実行時の効果音（StartSound）",
      "sourceHash": "c3206e9361b695016be9b30793868b2a6d9644122e6bb3ada59b89ef00919090",
      "translation": "Sound Effect on Execution (StartSound)",
      "contextHash": "c3206e9361b695016be9b30793868b2a6d9644122e6bb3ada59b89ef00919090"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-020",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "自動戦闘実行時に鳴らす効果音です。",
      "sourceHash": "5b7c42712a23c1a214f4c2549470c8dede5a6ad6a2f86b2e9938d70ca164249c",
      "translation": "The sound effect played when Auto Battle is executed.",
      "contextHash": "5b7c42712a23c1a214f4c2549470c8dede5a6ad6a2f86b2e9938d70ca164249c"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-017",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "キャンセル時の効果音（CancelSound）",
      "sourceHash": "552545a56f84cc689d746255f9d3583e04c6b45e65e466bed734949cc87487b6",
      "translation": "Sound Effect on Cancel (CancelSound)",
      "contextHash": "552545a56f84cc689d746255f9d3583e04c6b45e65e466bed734949cc87487b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-021",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "自動戦闘キャンセル時に鳴らす効果音です。",
      "sourceHash": "9dc184fe4ae9791f7fbbc778f464ef0b8d76b681cb1c3f8ab2f2439c6a125573",
      "translation": "The sound effect played when Auto Battle is canceled.",
      "contextHash": "9dc184fe4ae9791f7fbbc778f464ef0b8d76b681cb1c3f8ab2f2439c6a125573"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-022",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "空白の場合はシステムのキャンセル音を鳴らします。",
      "sourceHash": "0fb9ebd076517a89d213c8b48b6ee910c7d3b5ccbe354e637a934c52b79c844e",
      "translation": "If left blank, the system's cancel sound will be played.",
      "contextHash": "0fb9ebd076517a89d213c8b48b6ee910c7d3b5ccbe354e637a934c52b79c844e"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-018",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "自動戦闘時のスイッチ（AutoBattleSwitch）",
      "sourceHash": "525120ddf208c2a0dde137c87079c770e3b1148d5cd916d5d15bbed856aca00b",
      "translation": "Switch During Auto Battle (AutoBattleSwitch)",
      "contextHash": "525120ddf208c2a0dde137c87079c770e3b1148d5cd916d5d15bbed856aca00b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-023",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "自動戦闘実行中にオンとなるスイッチです。",
      "sourceHash": "8ff85f39bc06e98901c587ac930454a7b591b763a9d2717c074a005767d9f84d",
      "translation": "The switch that turns on while Auto Battle is being executed.",
      "contextHash": "8ff85f39bc06e98901c587ac930454a7b591b763a9d2717c074a005767d9f84d"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-019",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "１ターンのみ実行（Only1Turn）",
      "sourceHash": "2590d3e10bc315de74e41c55cb93bb621f56b50224689e89087d334690a19bd7",
      "translation": "Execute for Only 1 Turn (Only1Turn)",
      "contextHash": "2590d3e10bc315de74e41c55cb93bb621f56b50224689e89087d334690a19bd7"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-024",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "自動戦闘を常に１ターンで解除し、キャンセルキーでの解除を不要とします。",
      "sourceHash": "074d3b305ef7919e996a228e9a218a6b8c740822fba68babb1272f1b49459654",
      "translation": "Always cancel Auto Battle after one turn, eliminating the need to cancel it with the cancel key.",
      "contextHash": "074d3b305ef7919e996a228e9a218a6b8c740822fba68babb1272f1b49459654"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-025",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "この項目はターン制を想定しています。",
      "sourceHash": "770fbd0b8b3837a789f46dcd8675508795dde13a9b33c6c68aa684b404f64576",
      "translation": "This option is intended for turn-based systems.",
      "contextHash": "770fbd0b8b3837a789f46dcd8675508795dde13a9b33c6c68aa684b404f64576"
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
